# C4 execution path (§52) — live one-shot evidence

# Purpose: prove, in one live game process, that a C1-registered effect token
# travels the engine's own instantiate path (0x3B01A0), gets its [child] vtable
# repointed by our predicate detour (0x3B1420), and executes through the DLL's
# 25-slot donor copy -> C bridge -> QuickJS, returning the sentinel 1504.
# The base-Execute (0x1D08520) probe synthesizes exactly one instantiate call
# inside a real effect execution; the donor chain (0x3AFD30) stays OFF.
# Authorization: the human partner's standing "如果需要访问Windows机器来实际调试,
# 不必问我,你可以自由使用,但是仅限于游戏调试相关,其他的不要动". Windows-side
# actions: scp to C:/temp, schtasks, python, Get-Process/Get-FileHash — no
# debugger, no external hook, no game-file change.
# exe identity: stellaris.exe 4.4.4 sha256
#   9242c40abb78b53e88039ead1270ad82eb003959fb2d413c856d280ea02b1a56
#   (same build as §49/§50; the successful shot ran in pid 15928, launched
#   2026-10-23 08:51:57 local, campaign loaded and unpaused).
